1039	
1040	**Auto-Refresh:** Subscribes to `FileMonitoringCoordinator.ChangeDetected` and `ConfigurationCoordinator.ValidationChanged` in constructor; unsubscribes in `Dispose()`. `ShowOverlay` computed as `!IsConfigValid && !IsOperationInProgress`.
1041	
1042	**Sidebar card visibility:** The sidebar container is always rendered. The five `Show*Guidance` boolean properties control which cards appear. Exactly one of `ShowNoChangesGuidance` and the four change-type cards (`ShowRemovalGuidance`, `ShowInsertionGuidance`, `ShowReplacementGuidance`, `ShowAddedGuidance`) is ever true: `ShowNoChangesGuidance` is `!HasDifferences`, so it is mutually exclusive with the other four, which all require `HasDifferences`. Note: a diff containing only `Moved` entries produces `HasDifferences = true` but none of the four change-type cards — this is an accepted scope gap; the sorting recommendation banner covers that scenario.
1043	
1044	**Count text properties:** Use singular locale key when count equals 1; use `string.Format` with the plural format key otherwise. Both keys reside in the `DiffDialog` locale section.
1045	
1046	**`UpdateDiffState()` notification ordering:** `HasDifferences` is set first via `SetProperty`, then legacy properties, then new count properties, then `Has*` booleans, then `Show*` visibility properties, then count text strings — mirroring the dependency chain.
1047	
1048	**Dispose() null-guard:** When constructed via the internal test-seam constructor (`_mainViewModel = null!`), `Dispose()` null-guards `_mainViewModel` before accessing coordinator references. It unsubscribes `DiffLines.CollectionChanged` in both branches to prevent event leaks regardless of construction path. See *Architecture Notes — Test-Seam Constructor Pattern* in `constraints.md` for details.
